+
+## Phase 0: Setup
+
+```bash
+REPO=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner -q .nameWithOwner)
+REPORT_DIR="/tmp/$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)"
+mkdir -p "$REPORT_DIR"
+COMMIT_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)
+```
+
+Pass `REPO`, `REPORT_DIR`, and `COMMIT_SHA` to every subagent.
