+## 4. Integration Check
+
+### Config disable path
+- Add `"arxiv"` to `disabled_mcps` in test config → verify MCP excluded from `createBuiltinMcps()` output
+- This is already covered by the unit test, but can be manually verified:
+
+```typescript
